From 1e13b921d0ecd0faf1a9e374d251f2c2275d22be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 14:14:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 888/913] drivers: stm32_remoteproc: use TEE_Result for the
 status variable
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

stm32mp2_rproc_start stored TEE_Result values in an int, so an error
code overflowed the signed type before being returned by a function
declared to return TEE_Result.

Coverity issue: CID 1200007: Overflowed return value in stm32mp2_rproc_start

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git d53f8eccc13a16d024fa784c61efa3bf518c91f1 drivers: stm32_remoteproc: use TEE_Result for the status variable]
Assisted-by: GitHub-Copilot:Claude-Opus-5
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I8842b2228b83fdf2a77a35e0654ac730beb28263
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/597009
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Arnaud POULIQUEN <arnaud.pouliquen@st.com>
---
 core/drivers/remoteproc/stm32_remoteproc.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/drivers/remoteproc/stm32_remoteproc.c b/core/drivers/remoteproc/stm32_remoteproc.c
index af5aa7ec8..78fc5fee0 100644
--- a/core/drivers/remoteproc/stm32_remoteproc.c
+++ b/core/drivers/remoteproc/stm32_remoteproc.c
@@ -219,7 +219,7 @@ static TEE_Result stm32mp2_rproc_start(struct stm32_rproc_instance *rproc)
 	struct stm32_rproc_mem *mems = NULL;
 	unsigned int i = 0;
 	bool boot_addr_valid = false;
-	int res = TEE_ERROR_GENERIC;
+	TEE_Result res = TEE_ERROR_GENERIC;
 	paddr_t boot_pa = 0;
 
 	if (!rproc->boot_addr)
-- 
2.53.0

